02:00:50.458 --> 02:00:55.458
But I just want to today, because this was such an intense sermon.

1249
02:00:56.458 --> 02:00:57.458
Not sermon-like words.

1250
02:00:58.458 --> 02:01:01.458
While all eyes and all privacy are for everyone.

1251
02:01:02.458 --> 02:01:03.458
I just want to see your hand.

1252
02:01:04.458 --> 02:01:05.458
Has this spoken to you?

1253
02:01:06.458 --> 02:01:08.458
And do you want to refresh your love for Jesus, to put Him as number one again?

1254
02:01:09.458 --> 02:01:10.458
Then raise your hand.

1255
02:01:11.458 --> 02:01:12.458
Do you want to come to repentance again?

1256
02:01:13.458 --> 02:01:14.458
Raise your hand.

1257
02:01:15.458 --> 02:01:16.458
Do you want Jesus to be number one?

1258
02:01:17.458 --> 02:01:18.458
Do you want to guard this?

1259
02:01:19.458 --> 02:01:22.458
Do you know that there has been damage in your trust towards Him?

1260
02:01:23.458 --> 02:01:24.458
Raise your hand.

1261
02:01:25.458 --> 02:01:28.458
Hallelujah, Jesus, You see all these hands.

1262
02:01:29.458 --> 02:01:30.458
And You see it here.

1263
02:01:31.458 --> 02:01:33.458
I plead with You, Holy Spirit.

1264
02:01:34.458 --> 02:01:35.458
I plead with You, Jesus.

1265
02:01:36.458 --> 02:01:37.458
Do not take away the candle.

1266
02:01:38.458 --> 02:01:39.458
Refresh our faith.

1267
02:01:40.458 --> 02:01:41.458
Keep our rhyme.

1268
02:01:41.458 --> 02:01:42.458
Hold our rhyme.

1269
02:01:43.458 --> 02:01:46.458
Search every soul at this moment.

1270
02:01:47.458 --> 02:01:48.458
Who has their hands in the air.

1271
02:01:49.458 --> 02:01:52.458
Make our rhyme free from influences that are not Yours.

1272
02:01:53.458 --> 02:01:55.458
Make us clean at this moment.

1273
02:01:56.458 --> 02:01:58.458
Give us a new start at this moment.

1274
02:01:59.458 --> 02:02:01.458
Lord, I decide at this moment.

1275
02:02:02.458 --> 02:02:03.458
Say it in your own soul.

1276
02:02:04.458 --> 02:02:09.458
Lord, I decide at this moment to put You as number one.

1277
02:02:09.458 --> 02:02:11.458
In the mighty name of Jesus.

1278
02:02:12.458 --> 02:02:13.458
Hallelujah, be blessed, church.

1279
02:02:14.458 --> 02:02:15.458
You may lower your hand.

1280
02:02:16.458 --> 02:02:17.458
Let's give Him a round of applause.

1281
02:02:18.458 --> 02:02:19.458
Hallelujah.

1282
02:02:25.458 --> 02:02:28.458
I really hope this has been helpful for you.

1283
02:02:29.458 --> 02:02:30.458
And that you here in the coming week...

1284
02:02:31.458 --> 02:02:34.458
Let me really give you a task for this week.

1285
02:02:35.458 --> 02:02:36.458
Be busy with this this week...

1286
02:02:37.458 --> 02:02:38.458
Listen carefully, church.

1287
02:02:39.458 --> 02:02:40.458
Be engaged with this this week.

1288
02:02:41.458 --> 02:02:44.458
Let this not be just a moment on this Sunday morning.

1289
02:02:45.458 --> 02:02:46.458
Go into this week.

1290
02:02:47.458 --> 02:02:50.458
And ask on Tuesday evening or on Wednesday morning or on Thursday afternoon.

1291
02:02:51.458 --> 02:02:52.458
I don't care when.

1292
02:02:53.458 --> 02:02:57.458
But whenever you think for a moment about the church and about Jesus.

1293
02:02:58.458 --> 02:03:00.458
Then think immediately, okay, there was that task.

1294
02:03:01.458 --> 02:03:02.458
Just take a moment to talk to God.

1295
02:03:03.458 --> 02:03:05.458
And say, Lord, search my heart.

1296
02:03:06.458 --> 02:03:07.458
Lord, guard my soul.

1297
02:03:07.458 --> 02:03:08.458
I want to have you as number 1.

1298
02:03:09.458 --> 02:03:10.458
Is that agreed?

1299
02:03:11.458 --> 02:03:12.458
All right, cool. Dismissed. Hallelujah.

1300
02:03:13.458 --> 02:03:15.458
Thank you, Jesus. You are Lord.

1301
02:03:16.458 --> 02:03:18.458
I thank you, Lord, for this coming week.

1302
02:03:19.458 --> 02:03:20.458
We can raise our hands in the air.

1303
02:03:21.458 --> 02:03:22.458
Lord, I thank you for this coming week.

1304
02:03:23.458 --> 02:03:25.458
Lord, I thank you for the children's camp that is coming up.

1305
02:03:26.458 --> 02:03:27.458
I thank you for the youth camp that is coming up.

1306
02:03:28.458 --> 02:03:29.458
We hijack them in the name of Jesus.

1307
02:03:30.458 --> 02:03:32.458
With your love and your power and your majesty.

1308
02:03:33.458 --> 02:03:35.458
Lord, I want to pray that no accidents will happen.

1309
02:03:35.458 --> 02:03:37.458
Lord, I want to pray that there will be no evil influences,

1310
02:03:38.458 --> 02:03:40.458
no burning arrow of the enemy has the right to touch us.

1311
02:03:41.458 --> 02:03:42.458
In the name of Jesus.

1312
02:03:43.458 --> 02:03:46.458
And I pray in Jesus' name that these camps will work as transformation

1313
02:03:47.458 --> 02:03:48.458
for our children and our teenagers.

1314
02:03:49.458 --> 02:03:51.458
And that it would be a milestone in their lives.

1315
02:03:52.458 --> 02:03:53.458
And that it will never leave them.

1316
02:03:54.458 --> 02:03:55.458
And that Jesus will be number 1.

1317
02:03:56.458 --> 02:03:58.458
Forever and ever. Amen. Amen.
